---
import { CONTACT_URL, RECRUITMENT_URL } from "../../data/site";
---

<section
  class="border-y border-rule px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 md:py-28 xl:px-12 2xl:px-16"
  id="contact"
  aria-labelledby="contact-title"
>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-6 text-xs tracking-widest">
    <span>LET’S TALK</span>
    <span>次の一歩を、一緒に。</span>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 grid gap-9 md:mt-16 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr] md:items-end md:gap-[10%]">
    <h2
      id="contact-title"
      class="text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,4.75rem)] font-semibold leading-normal tracking-tight"
    >
      まだ、うまく
      <br />
      言葉にできなくても
      <br />
      <span class="text-secondary">大丈夫です。</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="max-w-md">
      <p class="mb-8 leading-loose text-secondary">
        まずは、いまの課題を聞かせてください。
        <br />
        何から始めるべきか決まっていない段階でも、ご相談いただけます。
      </p>
      <a
        class="flex min-h-14 items-center justify-between gap-12 bg-ink px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-canvas transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-white"
        href={CONTACT_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        相談する<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a
        class="mt-5 flex min-h-11 items-center justify-between gap-10 border-b border-ink py-3 text-sm hover:text-accent"
        href={RECRUITMENT_URL}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        INFLUで一緒に働く<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
